{
  "name": "Customer Service RAG Agent (n8n)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## RAG Agent (n8n version)\nReplaces `RAG_Agent.py` (customer-policy path only).\n\n**Lane 1 (top):** upload a policy PDF once -> chunk 1000/200 -> embed (all-mpnet-base-v2, 768d) -> MongoDB Atlas `rag_agent.customer_policies`.\n\n**Lane 2 (bottom):** chat -> agent (Groq) with memory + policy search tool -> LLM evaluator (confidence) -> answer or safe fallback.\n\n**Setup:** attach the 3 credentials (Mongo, HuggingFace, Groq). The Atlas vector index `customer_vector_index` must exist (768 dims, cosine, path `embedding`).\n\n**Do NOT re-run lane 1 on a collection that is already populated** (it would insert duplicates).",
        "height": 420,
        "width": 520,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "ba97f678-7aac-5e6e-8a16-9d07b45da93c",
      "name": "Note - Overview",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -120,
        -60
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Confidence guardrail\nA second Groq call grades the answer against the retrieved passages. If `confidence < 0.6` or `grounded = false`, the user gets the safe fallback instead of the answer. Change the threshold in the IF node.",
        "height": 200,
        "width": 420,
        "color": 6
      },
      "id": "beef5007-1b24-5756-9fe4-f43eda969e96",
      "name": "Note - Guardrail",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1240,
        560
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "formTitle": "Upload customer policy PDF",
        "formDescription": "One-time ingestion into the customer_policies collection.",
        "formFields": {
          "values": [
            {
              "fieldLabel": "Policy PDF",
              "fieldType": "file",
              "multipleFiles": false,
              "acceptFileTypes": ".pdf",
              "requiredField": true
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "5ae93b60-7123-563f-98fd-c131d74027d0",
      "name": "Upload Policy PDF",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.formTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        200,
        100
      ],
      "webhookId": "026d0028-e1d6-597f-9faa-08d0ee6fa61f"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "insert",
        "mongoCollection": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "name",
          "value": "customer_policies"
        },
        "embedding": "embedding",
        "metadata_field": "text",
        "vectorIndexName": "customer_vector_index",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "15d83281-153d-51f2-9ef2-ca47b5b46423",
      "name": "Insert Into Customer Policies",
